%% title: How a student's status changes
%% desc: An active student leaves in one of three ways: withdrawn becomes inactive, transferred to another school becomes transferred, graduated becomes graduated; readmitting makes them active again.
flowchart LR
  A["Active"]:::done -->|"Record leaving<br/>Withdrawn"| N["Inactive"]
  A -->|"Transferred to<br/>another school"| S["Transferred"]
  A -->|"Graduated"| G["Graduated"]
  N -->|"Readmit"| A
  S -->|"Readmit"| A
  G -->|"Readmit"| A
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
